Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.89,0:00:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for having called you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:08.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is from Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hospital charges, \Nas well as doctor's fees,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,food expenses while in the hospital, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.35,0:00:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All to be paid for by the \NEastern Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snack food charges?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reading materials charges...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As well as a large bill \Nfrom a toy store...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:46.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They have left on a trip \Nto further their objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I believe they will contact us before long, \Nso for the time being...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I asked you where they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.14,0:00:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.60,0:00:56.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are the Elric brothers here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, they aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:06.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where have they gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh, um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.93,0:01:09.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! Nice going, dear. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.95,0:01:25.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.70,0:01:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:29.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're finally here! Rush Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:34.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That ring is the new model from Studio Remis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.59,0:03:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought I'd be laying eyes on it in this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Buy it, buy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bet, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:45.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This Automail is the 1911 Gods' model!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would've thought the day would come when I'd be able to behold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How nice! I sure would like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sure is nice. \NLet me put it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:07.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.29,0:04:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A culverin cannon is \Nmade for men's ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:14.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A girl like you doesn't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what a shabby little store this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pops, let me have the \Nstrongest thing you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:28.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've come into some easy money, and I'm going to blow it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:34.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't ignore a customer, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:38.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's that? Fine little piece, isn't it? \NStick it on me, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:39.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:45.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only give my Automail to people who really need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You what?! I'm a customer here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need something like this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with you, \Nyou nasty old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who needs your broken-down Automail, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.51,0:05:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hack mechanic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! It's what Rush Valley is famous for! Automail arm wrestling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Entrance fee is 10,000 cens! Beat the champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:23.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you win all the money collected so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come and take it, you thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:28.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:31.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! I'll step up to the plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, way to go, mister! \NYou're sure fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready... Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:52.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready... Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, did you see that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:05:59.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready... Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.32,0:06:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing they could do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little lady, are you sure you're okay with that substandard rig of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:15.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is crazy! After all, \Nshe's using that old fart's Automail!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:23.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:54.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you like, I can introduce you \Nto an able craftsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, are there any challengers who want to go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:07.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:11.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The strong-looking gentleman there! How about going a round?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:13.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, me? No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:18.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Well, how about the—\Nor so I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:21.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but calling out such a bean sprout of a boy wouldn't be right of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.71,0:07:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me a bean sprout!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, he's got a lot of energy for a bean sprout, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although, his Automail is awfully shoddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, let Ed go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:35.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:44.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed! Don't you dare lose to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:50.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.86,0:07:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:03.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that. The scrap collectors are going to be really busy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:12.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neener neener!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,510,000 cens!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.76,0:08:21.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this much, I can buy \Nall of those parts that I wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.51,0:08:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what I'm really happy about is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:42.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the guys who were just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really did a number \Non us back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to get hurt, \Nhand over that money quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?! \NWe beat you fair and square for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! That bean sprout obviously cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?! \NYou used alchemy, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You used it too, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, did you use alchemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.58,0:09:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.66,0:09:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, you knew about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:08.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.95,0:09:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:13.40,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hurt! What are you doing, Win—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.49,0:09:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've brought Major Armstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:55.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there are those whom we suspect were \Nthe ones who killed the Brigadier General.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:02.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, why haven't \Nyou arrested them at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are suspected, \Nbut we don't know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:08.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.34,0:10:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a colonel, \NI am instructing you to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:12.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said those whom we suspect \Nwere the {\i1}ones{\i0} who killed Hughes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which means there was more than one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he wouldn't answer me, \Neven when I ordered him to as a colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it means that someone with a rank higher than mine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,has forbidden the Major \Nto talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:44.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, like Lieutenant Ross said,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:46.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,since the Elric brothers are taking independent action
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:49.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,without reporting to me first,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:53.67,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,we have to consider that the military is involved with the Philosopher's Stone somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That couldn't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\t(1860,4230,\c&H000000&,\3c&H000000&,\4c&H000000&)}As it is, we're in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:06.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry's nowhere to be found, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was a bad idea to use alchemy when you were arm wrestling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys were cheating, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:31.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hurt your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:35.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw you at the \Narm wrestling competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.29,0:11:40.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mind if I sit next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:46.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are your legs Automail, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. \NI'm surprised you could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm an artificial-limb outfitter myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hurt your arm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.15,0:12:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible. The working is \Nsimple yet high-performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wasted in this design.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a load on \Nyour suspension here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:15.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've bent a cylinder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can tell that quickly \Njust by looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoever made this \Nhas incredible skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should have them \Ntake a look at this right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, how did you \Ncome to have Automail?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:45.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was in a train accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he's the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:19.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He took me in and even gave me \Nan arm and a pair of legs. Dominic-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, shouldn't you have him \Nfix you up all the more?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:31.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:39.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to tell him that \NI lost the arm wrestling contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.11,0:13:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to prove that \Nhis Automail was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:48.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, all you need to do is show that your Automail is amazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:03.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh... But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:06.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know what? You could show that your Automail is amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.65,0:14:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by beating a State Alchemist who also has Automail, couldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:12.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might be right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:15.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:18.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:28.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Paninya, what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Dominic-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:35.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry to intrude. I'm Winry Rockbell, \Nan Automail mechanic from Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rockbell from Resembool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me you're Pinako's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.61,0:14:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The leopardess of Resembool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just thinking about her horrifies me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you an acquaintance \Nof my grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.72,0:14:52.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.79,0:14:59.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do as you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, where is that Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:13.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she slept outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.79,0:15:20.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.33,0:15:22.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dumb jerk, that's my line!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I flew off \Nthe handle yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:27.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were there when \Nwe were arm wrestling...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.94,0:15:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her name's Paninya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:34.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I stayed over at \Nher house last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:35.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.41,0:15:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I take a look at \Nyour silver watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this about, \Nall of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.24,0:15:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:51.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a contest, Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:59.02,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,If you can get your silver watch back before Paninya takes it to the pawn shop, you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.89,0:16:05.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pipsqueak, come on up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't give chase quickly, you can kiss your watch good-bye, Mr. Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:13.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, why would you \Ndo such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:22.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want Ed to say
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:25.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that her Automail is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:30.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:45.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're hanging in there pretty well, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:46.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bet I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like a cat! Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about you use that \Ntrademark alchemy of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.31,0:17:00.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop jerking me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.21,0:17:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, how about \Nreturning my silver watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take this! My 1.5-inch culverin cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:23.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:24.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:27.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:33.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see... The pawn shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.81,0:17:36.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:38.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow-ow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I was so close, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:04.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your reasons are,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't let anyone beat me \Nwhen it comes to my Automail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:21.92,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Aww! And here, all I wanted to do was show Dominic-san how amazing his Automail is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was plenty amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, \Nyou stupid little girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:30.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't need you \Nto do that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, your Automail isn't just some device.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're your very limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they're yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember raising any daughters who weren't aware of such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.53,0:18:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:57.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You make your Automail with the person in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:19:01.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It becomes a part of that \Nperson's body, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:10.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I was glad when I was able to \Nstand on my own two feet once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:24.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, Colonel,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you can, locate the criminal who \Ndid that to Brigadier General Hughes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:31.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:34.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The investigation concerning his death in the line of duty
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:36.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,has already been suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.95,0:19:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why I'm asking you, Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Working hard as usual, eh, Mustang-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been too long, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard the rumors that you were being relocated to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't necessarily mean it won't be overruled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I could ask for your support, I will serve you to my fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I humbly look forward \Nto your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.65,0:20:05.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the right attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.18,0:20:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm heading upward. \NWill you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You need to ask, \Nafter all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then, if you'll excuse us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:27.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:29.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give Winry our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.50,0:20:52.61,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Say, I noticed earlier that it looks like you've gotten surprisingly taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:54.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Course I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means that before long, I'll need to get a new arm and leg ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:21:00.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it? Why don't \Nwe go back to Resembool?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm okay for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.02,0:21:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.00,0:21:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it that you simply \Ndon't want Automail?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.49,0:21:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:25.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll study harder and harder,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:28.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to keep you from being handicapped for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we want to get our bodies back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:44.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something we have \Nto do for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:56.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad news, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:45.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 27: "Sensei"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.71,0:23:48.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive us, Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.12,0:23:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for what we did to our mother.
